### Health
GET http://localhost:8091/health

### Create summary
POST http://localhost:8091/api/v1/summaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversation_id": 789,
  "messages": [
    {"id": 1, "sender": "user", "content": "Здравствуйте. Я вчера оплатил подписку.", "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:00:00Z"},
    {"id": 2, "sender": "user", "content": "Деньги списались, но доступ не появился.", "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:01:00Z"},
    {"id": 3, "sender": "operator", "content": "Попробуйте выйти из аккаунта и войти снова.", "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:03:00Z"},
    {"id": 4, "sender": "user", "content": "Попробовал, ничего не изменилось.", "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:05:00Z"}
  ]
}

### Latest summary
GET http://localhost:8091/api/v1/summaries/789

### Summary history
GET http://localhost:8091/api/v1/summaries/789/history

### Regenerate summary
POST http://localhost:8091/api/v1/summaries/789/regenerate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {"id": 1, "sender": "user", "content": "Оплатил подписку, но доступа нет.", "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:00:00Z"}
  ]
}
